All sample mails, bank exports, people, companies, e-mail domains and IBANs in samples/ and tests/ are invented,
with these exceptions, used on purpose as known fixtures:
- the published IBANs of the Belastingdienst, DUO and CJIB (countersign_shadow/official.py and its tests), as
  known-legitimate public payees;
- the public consumer mail domain gmail.com, for invented senders writing from a private mailbox;
- the public example IBAN NL91ABNA0417164301;
- a few real company names (for example Adyen, PayPal, Hubo) in invented mails; their sender domains are
  example.* domains. These mails were not sent by those companies.
